[{"id":3299787478,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ErsLW","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. This is a great improvement :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [ssr_volumetric_fog_bug_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22684104/ssr_volumetric_fog_bug_2.zip)\r\n\r\nExamples in motion in https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection (using FSR2 native, SSR with 512 steps, fade in/out `0.001`, depth tolerance `0.5`):\r\n\r\n### SSR only\r\n\r\n[reflection_ssr.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18845c1d-ad66-40ec-95ed-8988d0045e92)\r\n\r\n### SSR + SDFGI\r\n\r\n*SDFGI provides fallback reflections when screen-space information is not available, which improves the robustness of reflections.*\r\n\r\n[reflection_ssr_sdfgi.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f46dec9-bcaf-49ae-a04e-7b3bed80cc26)\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 42)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- The on-screen size of reflections no longer depends on viewport 3D resolution, which is a good thing.\r\n\r\n- On materials that have a roughness of exactly `0.0`, NaN artifacts will appear if the material's specular mode is **Shlick-GGX** (the default). The issue depends on viewport resolution and camera angle. Note that even on `master`, the floor will display NaNs in the specular lobe (possibly similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110207). This may just be exhibiting an issue somewhere else in the core PBR shader.\r\n\r\n:warning: **Flashing images in this video** :warning: \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/adfee60f-adb5-4cd6-8567-818bd7b76500\r\n\r\n- Very low **Max Steps** values look broken. I'd probably limit the lower bound in the inspector to 32 steps (half the default value):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ef65624-29ba-4cc2-bf37-f57a9f94d183\r\n\r\n- Setting **Fade Out** to exactly `0.0` by right-clicking the value and choosing the **Zero** preset results in NaNs, even if the material has its specular mode set to **Disabled**:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"261\" height=\"162\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08893f74-6980-473d-9b6c-f70c5a00bfd6\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1186\" height=\"639\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2dfa8580-58ab-4a5d-978d-760ca4e8591d\" />\r\n\r\nClamping the value to `0.001` in the shader should avoid this.\r\n\r\n- Now that the size of reflections is no longer resolution-dependent, this could be a good opportunity to add an option to render SSR at full resolution (disabled by default). There are two main reasons you'd want to do this:\r\n\r\n  - Improve SSR sharpness and stability when using upscaling, e.g. FSR2 or MetalFX at low resolution scales.\r\n  - Ensure the highest possible SSR quality for [Movie Maker mode](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/animation/creating_movies.html).","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111210#pullrequestreview-3299787478","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111210","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111210#pullrequestreview-3299787478"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111210"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-03T16:14:19Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3342267558,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7HNvSm","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111210#pullrequestreview-3342267558","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111210","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111210#pullrequestreview-3342267558"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng